webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1147\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1148\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Can I set up a goal event when a contact does NOT open an email or click a link?</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1149\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1150\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Goal events currently support positive conditions, i.e., when a contact takes a certain action. Negative conditions, such as not opening an email, are not currently supported for goal events.<br data-identifyelement=\"1151\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1152\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"573\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"2.-Clicked-a-Trigger-Link:\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; font-size: 1.17em; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"556\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">2. Clicked a Trigger Link:</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1686037311404\" data-identifyelement=\"573\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">For the \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"574\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Clicked Trigger link,</strong>\" please select the trigger links listed in the dropdown menu. If you have not created a trigger link, please create one before proceeding.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155000618040/original/nM9BaE78J9oHahNEhB82wj3v10bKARZv2g1b26.gif?1686138227\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155000618040\"></p><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1686037316300\" data-identifyelement=\"1153\" id=\"Usage-Cases:-1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1154\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1686037348883\" data-identifyelement=\"1155\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Usage Cases:</strong></h4><ul class=\"tdfocus-1686037357820\" data-identifyelement=\"1156\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1686037331547\" data-identifyelement=\"1157\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Website Engagement: Move contacts to a workflow step designed for engaged users when they click on a specific link on your website.</li><li class=\"tdfocus-1686037337332\" data-identifyelement=\"1158\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Survey Responses: Use different trigger links for different survey responses, moving the contact to a tailored workflow step based on their response.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1159\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Product Interest: Move contacts to a workflow designed to nurture interest in a specific product or service when they click a link related to that product.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1160\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Content Marketing: If you've shared a blog post or a guide, set a goal event for when a contact clicks the link to the content, triggering a follow-up workflow to gauge their interest or gather feedback.</li><li class=\"tdfocus-1686037355051\" data-identifyelement=\"1161\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Webinar Signups: If promoting a webinar, trigger a follow-up workflow when a contact clicks on the registration link.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1162\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">eCommerce Purchase: If you're an eCommerce business, trigger a post-purchase workflow when a contact clicks on a \"Buy Now\" or \"Add to Cart\" link.</li><li class=\"tdfocus-1686037393253\" data-identifyelement=\"1163\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Membership or Subscription Signups: If you're promoting a membership or subscription, trigger a welcome workflow when a contact clicks the signup link.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1164\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Trial Activation: For software companies offering a free trial, trigger an onboarding workflow when a contact clicks on the \"Activate Trial\" link.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1165\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Affiliate Marketing: If you're an affiliate marketer, trigger a follow-up workflow when a contact clicks on your affiliate link.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1166\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Download Confirmation: If you're offering a free resource download, set a goal event for when a contact clicks the download link, triggering a follow-up workflow to engage the contact further.</li></ul><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1167\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"FAQs:-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1168\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1169\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">FAQs:</strong></h4><p class=\"tdfocus-1686037651668\" data-identifyelement=\"1170\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1171\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What if a contact clicks the trigger link before they enter the workflow? Will it still trigger the goal event?</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1172\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1173\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">No, a contact needs to be in the workflow and meet the goal conditions during that time for the Trigger Link Clicked Goal Event to be activated.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1174\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1175\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1176\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">If a contact clicks a trigger link multiple times, will it trigger the goal event each time?</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1177\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1178\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">No, once a contact meets a particular Trigger Link Clicked Goal Event, they won't be evaluated for the same goal event again in that workflow.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1179\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1180\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1181\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What happens if a contact clicks a trigger link but does not meet other conditions for the Goal Event?</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1182\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1183\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">The contact will not be moved to the Goal Event step unless they meet all conditions set for that goal event.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1686037386837\" data-identifyelement=\"1184\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1185\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1186\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Can a trigger link from any website be used for the Trigger Link Clicked Goal Event?</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1187\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows"}, {"slug": "48001238271-action-update-contact-field", "title": "Action - Update Contact Field", "folder": "Workflow", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48294379946/original/7uOQh_K68fa9-BSrLtJLo_Xiz2Pyqqu9Rg127f.png?1682435188", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48294379954/original/fALHu-xTp-pwoBYc4x-BSr8hw9V5pv96egcf0f.jpg?1682435190", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48294379950/original/yMFL3kKEwjtxlegk1_tcUtduPEaEbYbMHA8041.png?1682435189", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48294379953/original/Y3ZWm6EgjBJ7SzWb6P5n84l2UDCYtxm0Qwcf0f.png?1682435190", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48294379952/original/R_l1ysiuuZWmlIXCv-K1g1Qsx1bQjS88Zg8041.png?1682435189"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"tdfocus-1682434381105\" dir=\"ltr\">This article explains workflows' \"Update Contact Field\" and \"Clear Field Data\" actions. The former allows updating a contact field with a new value, either static or dynamic, while the latter clears the existing value of a custom contact field. Both actions are currently supported for Contact Custom Fields only.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1682434381105\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h4 class=\"fd-toc tdfocus-1682435198710\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Covered in this Article</span></strong></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-is-the-Update-Contact-Field-Action-in-Workflows?\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">What is the Update Contact Field Action in Workflows?</strong></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1682435226551\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-are-some-good-usage-cases-for-this?\">What are some good usage cases for this?</a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-use-this-action?\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How to use this action?</strong></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Select-Update/Clear-Field-Data\">Select Update/Clear Field Data</a></span></h4><h4 style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Update-Field-Data\">Update Field Data</a></span></h4><h4 style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Clear-Field-Data\">Clear Field Data</a></span></h4><p class=\"tdfocus-1682434381105\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1682434381105\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><hr><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1682434111966\" data-identifyelement=\"1041\" id=\"What-is-the-Update-Contact-Field-Action-in-Workflows?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1682434070040\" data-identifyelement=\"1042\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What is the Update Contact Field Action in Workflows?</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1682434101117\" data-identifyelement=\"1043\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The update contact field action in workflows allows you to update the value of a specific field for a contact. With this action, you can specify a new value for the field, and the contact's existing field value will be replaced with the new value. However, with the new feature, you can also clear the field, i.e., empty the input field or reset it to the default value.<br><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1682434101117\" data-identifyelement=\"1043\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Please Note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">It's important to note that the clear field data feature currently supports only the Contact Custom Fields.&nbsp;</span></pre><p class=\"tdfocus-1682434101117\" data-identifyelement=\"1043\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br>You can use this action to update or clear multiple fields with static or custom values anywhere in the workflow. The fields can be dynamically updated in workflows wherever they are being used.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1044\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1045\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1046\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ro