e Violations?</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1666643345294\" data-identifyelement=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1666794712035\" data-identifyelement=\"651\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">When we identify a violation of these principles, we will work with customers in good faith to get them back into compliance with the messaging policy. However, to protect the continued ability of all our customers to use messaging for legitimate purposes freely, we reserve the right to <u data-identifyelement=\"712\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">suspend or remove access to the platform for customers or customers\u2019 end users that we determine are not complying with the Messaging Policy</u>, or who are not following the law in any applicable area or applicable communications industry guidelines or standards, in some instances with limited notice in the case of serious violations of this policy.</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1666810655274\" data-identifyelement=\"490\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webki