ize: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Select your Business Category (e.g., E-commerce, Health &amp; Wellness).</span></span></span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Tap Next, and follow the prompts to complete the setup.</span></span></li></ul><hr><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30px; font-size: 1.17em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Step 2:</strong> Connect <strong>Instagram</strong> to your <strong>Facebook Page</strong></span></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">A:&nbsp;</span></strong><s