); font-weight: 700;\">Q: Will tags created on the fly appear in my CRM tags list?</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;Yes. Any tag created during scheduling will be saved and visible in your CRM\u2019s overall Tags list for future use.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Q: Do I always need to enable Automate?</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;Only if you want the tags to trigger specific automations. You can add tags without enabling Automate if you just want to segment your audience.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Q: Can I add multiple new tags at the same time?</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;Yes. You